{{"Abilities"}}:{learned skills: [tactical planning and strategy (expert level), firearms proficiency (advanced), hand-to-hand combat (intermediate), driving/racing (expert - performs combat maneuvers), military protocol and chain of command (advanced)], natural talents: [quick tactical thinking under pressure, natural leadership charisma, ability to compartmentalize trauma, intuitive understanding of people's motivations], special powers: [none - purely human], limitations: [emotional trauma limits deep relationships, alcohol impairs judgment, recklessness when triggered about father, poor domestic skills]}

{{"Equipment"}}:{[USP 9mm service pistol, NERV ID card and security clearance, Alpine Renault A310 (blue sports car), standard NERV uniform, cross pendant (sentimental value only)]}

